Charmed</button><button class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors bg-surface-raised text-muted hover:bg-accent-red-bg hover:text-accent-red-text shadow-sm">Deafened</button><button class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors bg-surface-raised text-muted hover:bg-accent-red-bg hover:text-accent-red-text shadow-sm">Frightened</button><button class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors bg-surface-raised text-muted hover:bg-accent-red-bg hover:text-accent-red-text shadow-sm">Grappled</button><button class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors bg-surface-raised text-muted hover:bg-accent-red-bg hover:text-accent-red-text shadow-sm">Incapacitated</button><button class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors bg-surface-raised text-muted hover:bg-accent-red-bg hover:text-accent-red-text shadow-sm">Invisible</button><button class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors bg-surface-raised text-muted hover:bg-accent-red-bg hover:text-accent-red-text shadow-sm">Paralyzed</button><button class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors bg-surface-raised text-muted hover:bg-accent-red-bg hover:text-accent-red-text shadow-sm">Petrified</button><button class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors bg-surface-raised text-muted hover:bg-accent-red-bg hover:text-accent-red-text shadow-sm">Poisoned</button><button disabled="" class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors bg-accent-red-bg text-accent-red-text cursor-not-allowed opacity-60">Prone</button><button class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors bg-surface-ra